@startuml
robust "Task Periodic (T=2s)" as P
robust "Task Sporadic (MIN_INTER=5s)" as S
robust "Task Aperiodic (Comenzi)" as A

@0
P is Idle
S is Idle
A is Idle

@0
P is Executing
@0.1
P is Idle

@2
P is Executing
@2.1
P is Idle
S is Executing : Alarmă Acceptată (t=2.1s)
@2.2
S is Idle

@4
P is Executing
@4.1
P is Idle
S is Rejected : Alarmă RESPINSĂ (dt=2.0s < 5.0s)
@4.2
S is Idle

@5.5
A is Executing : Comandă SET_INTERVAL (t=5.5s)
@5.6
A is Idle

@6
P is Executing
@6.1
P is Idle

@8
P is Executing
@8.1
P is Idle
S is Executing : Alarmă Acceptată (dt=6.1s >= 5.0s)
@8.2
S is Idle

@10
P is Executing
@10.1
P is Idle
@enduml
